title: "brain-states-friends: Brain-state analysis for longitudinal Friends fMRI data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for quantifying context-invariant and context-variant brain
  states during longitudinal naturalistic TV viewing (the TV show "Friends")
  using sticky Hierarchical Dirichlet Process Hidden Markov Models (sHDP-HMM).
